# Lines the faction soldier AI shouts. Picked through the NpcSoldierCallout* localized datasets in
# Prototypes/_Crescent/Datasets/npc_soldier_callouts.yml: a faction's own set when it has one, the generic
# set otherwise. Counts there have to match the numbers here.

